WEBVTT

1
00:00:30.083 --> 00:00:32.750
In the previous verses, Lord Krishna

2
00:00:32.750 --> 00:00:37.083
gave an initial introduction
to His divine vibhutis.

3
00:00:37.083 --> 00:00:40.041
Now in these verses, Lord Krishna

4
00:00:40.041 --> 00:00:44.708
begins a detailed description
of His divine glories.

5
00:00:44.708 --> 00:00:48.416
He explains how He is present

6
00:00:48.416 --> 00:00:51.500
in the most prominent and awe-inspiring

7
00:00:51.500 --> 00:00:53.541
aspects of creation.

8
00:00:53.541 --> 00:00:56.750
These examples help Arjun and other seekers

9
00:00:56.750 --> 00:00:58.583
to see Lord Krishna's

10
00:00:58.583 --> 00:01:00.083
grandeur in daily

11
00:01:00.083 --> 00:01:01.958
experiences.

12
00:01:01.958 --> 00:01:05.041
They become a means to draw the mind toward

13
00:01:05.041 --> 00:01:07.041
Lord Krishna.

14
00:01:11.875 --> 00:01:13.125
Lord Krishna reveals

15
00:01:13.125 --> 00:01:14.291
His divine presence

16
00:01:14.291 --> 00:01:17.125
in various aspects of creation.

17
00:01:17.125 --> 00:01:18.125
He shows

18
00:01:18.125 --> 00:01:21.291
that He manifests through the most prominent

19
00:01:21.291 --> 00:01:24.458
and attractive elements of the material world.

20
00:01:24.458 --> 00:01:25.875
Among the Adityas,

21
00:01:25.875 --> 00:01:26.916
Lord Krishna identifies

22
00:01:26.916 --> 00:01:29.333
Himself as Vishnu.

23
00:01:29.333 --> 00:01:30.791
All the Adityas

24
00:01:30.791 --> 00:01:34.083
are sons of rishi Kashyapa and Aditi.

25
00:01:34.083 --> 00:01:36.500
The sons born of Kashyapa's other wife Diti

26
00:01:36.500 --> 00:01:39.000
are called the Daityas.

27
00:01:39.000 --> 00:01:41.583
Among luminous things, Lord Krishna

28
00:01:41.583 --> 00:01:44.333
declares Himself to be the radiant sun.

29
00:01:44.333 --> 00:01:47.041
The sun's brilliance illuminates the earth

30
00:01:47.041 --> 00:01:49.500
and nourishes life.

31
00:01:49.500 --> 00:01:52.916
The sun, with its unmatched radiance,

32
00:01:52.916 --> 00:01:53.875
reflects only a fraction

33
00:01:53.875 --> 00:01:54.875
of Lord Krishna's

34
00:01:54.875 --> 00:01:58.208
infinite glory.

35
00:01:58.208 --> 00:02:01.000
Similarly, among the winds, He is Marichi,

36
00:02:01.000 --> 00:02:02.833
and identifies Himself

37
00:02:02.833 --> 00:02:05.125
as the chief of the Maruts.

38
00:02:05.125 --> 00:02:07.041
This shows His power

39
00:02:07.041 --> 00:02:09.458
in the forces of nature.

40
00:02:09.458 --> 00:02:12.833
Among celestial bodies,
Lord Krishna is the moon.

41
00:02:12.833 --> 00:02:13.916
The moon's gentle

42
00:02:13.916 --> 00:02:15.375
light inspires beauty

43
00:02:15.375 --> 00:02:17.791
and nourishment.

44
00:02:17.791 --> 00:02:19.333
Then Lord Krishna

45
00:02:19.333 --> 00:02:22.208
moves to knowledge and governance.

46
00:02:22.208 --> 00:02:25.500
Among the Vedas, He identifies
Himself as the Sama Veda.

47
00:02:25.500 --> 00:02:27.958
The Sama Veda is known
for its melodious hymns

48
00:02:27.958 --> 00:02:31.625
and devotion-inspiring verses.

49
00:02:31.625 --> 00:02:34.083
Among the devas, Lord Krishna is Indra.

50
00:02:34.083 --> 00:02:36.041
The king of heaven,

51
00:02:36.041 --> 00:02:39.708
Indra, symbolises power and leadership.

52
00:02:39.708 --> 00:02:40.583
Among the senses,

53
00:02:40.583 --> 00:02:43.166
He declares Himself to be the mind.

54
00:02:43.166 --> 00:02:45.625
The mind coordinates and governs

55
00:02:45.625 --> 00:02:47.708
the other senses.

56
00:02:47.708 --> 00:02:49.958
The mind's immense power

57
00:02:49.958 --> 00:02:53.333
influences the perceptions
and actions of a being.

58
00:02:53.333 --> 00:02:55.791
This power reflects Lord Krishna's role

59
00:02:55.791 --> 00:03:00.750
as the guide of all living beings.

60
00:03:00.750 --> 00:03:04.000
Within living beings, He is consciousness,

61
00:03:04.000 --> 00:03:05.750
the very essence of life.

62
00:03:05.750 --> 00:03:08.541
This shows that Lord Krishna

63
00:03:08.541 --> 00:03:11.791
is the supreme source of
awareness and life force.

64
00:03:11.791 --> 00:03:13.125
Moving on,

65
00:03:13.125 --> 00:03:14.750
Lord Krishna says

66
00:03:14.750 --> 00:03:17.125
that among the Rudras, He is Shankar.

67
00:03:17.125 --> 00:03:19.083
Shiva's destructive power

68
00:03:19.083 --> 00:03:20.916
serves Lord Krishna's purpose

69
00:03:20.916 --> 00:03:24.083
of maintaining the balance of the world.

70
00:03:24.083 --> 00:03:27.500
Among the Yakshas and Rakshasas,
He is Kubera.

71
00:03:27.500 --> 00:03:29.750
The treasurer of the devas,

72
00:03:29.750 --> 00:03:33.208
Kubera, is a symbol of wealth and prosperity.

73
00:03:33.208 --> 00:03:34.166
Among the Vasus,

74
00:03:34.166 --> 00:03:37.166
He identifies Himself as Agni – fire.

75
00:03:37.166 --> 00:03:39.625
Fire's transformative energy

76
00:03:39.625 --> 00:03:41.083
represents Lord Krishna's ability

77
00:03:41.083 --> 00:03:45.583
to purify and sustain all things.

78
00:03:45.583 --> 00:03:47.541
Among mountains, He is Mount Meru.

79
00:03:47.541 --> 00:03:50.833
Mount Meru is considered the axis of creation.

80
00:03:50.833 --> 00:03:53.875
This reflects Lord Krishna's central role

81
00:03:53.875 --> 00:03:58.208
in maintaining balance and grandeur.

82
00:03:58.208 --> 00:03:59.041
Finally,

83
00:03:59.041 --> 00:03:59.666
Lord Krishna

84
00:03:59.666 --> 00:04:00.291
sheds light

85
00:04:00.291 --> 00:04:03.958
on roles of authority and vastness.

86
00:04:03.958 --> 00:04:06.500
Among priests, He is Brihaspati.

87
00:04:06.500 --> 00:04:09.208
The teacher of the devas, Brihaspati,

88
00:04:09.208 --> 00:04:13.583
is a symbol of knowledge
and spiritual guidance.

89
00:04:13.583 --> 00:04:16.500
Among commanders of armies, He is Kartikeya.

90
00:04:16.500 --> 00:04:20.416
The fearless commander of the divine forces,

91
00:04:20.416 --> 00:04:21.541
Kartikeya,

92
00:04:21.541 --> 00:04:22.666
in protecting dharma,

93
00:04:22.666 --> 00:04:26.750
represents Lord Krishna's power.

94
00:04:26.750 --> 00:04:29.958
Among all bodies of water, He is the ocean.

95
00:04:29.958 --> 00:04:33.166
The vastness and depth of the ocean

96
00:04:33.166 --> 00:04:37.250
symbolise His limitless and unfathomable glory.

97
00:04:37.250 --> 00:04:40.375
These manifestations are not
objects of worship in themselves,

98
00:04:40.375 --> 00:04:43.708
but glimpses of Lord Krishna's greatness.

99
00:04:43.708 --> 00:04:45.083
Lord Krishna

100
00:04:45.083 --> 00:04:47.666
is the source of all greatness.

101
00:04:47.666 --> 00:04:54.041
He is the essence of everything
that draws our attention and respect.

102
00:04:54.041 --> 00:04:56.916
But remember, the correct approach

103
00:04:56.916 --> 00:04:59.166
is to contemplate Lord Krishna as the source

104
00:04:59.166 --> 00:05:01.166
of all these magnificent manifestations.

105
00:05:01.166 --> 00:05:03.875
If one sees these great manifestations

106
00:05:03.875 --> 00:05:05.500
as independent, without recognising

107
00:05:05.500 --> 00:05:08.750
Lord Krishna at their root,

108
00:05:08.750 --> 00:05:12.500
this error can mislead the intellect

109
00:05:12.500 --> 00:05:13.875
and ultimately

110
00:05:13.875 --> 00:05:17.875
lead one away from the path of devotion.

111
00:05:22.500 --> 00:05:25.375
When you understand My

112
00:05:25.375 --> 00:05:30.750
presence in every particle of this world,

113
00:05:30.750 --> 00:05:33.958
then your perspective on life

114
00:05:33.958 --> 00:05:36.458
becomes positive.

115
00:05:36.458 --> 00:05:39.958
Rain, sunshine, a cool breeze,

116
00:05:39.958 --> 00:05:44.083
greenery, the bloom of flowers,
the movement of planets –

117
00:05:44.083 --> 00:05:49.041
on such countless events, big and small,

118
00:05:49.041 --> 00:05:52.625
have you ever reflected?

119
00:05:52.625 --> 00:05:58.041
Who drives all of this?

120
00:05:58.041 --> 00:06:02.916
Look within the depths of your own mind.

121
00:06:02.916 --> 00:06:06.708
The wonderful ability to think, feel,

122
00:06:06.708 --> 00:06:11.541
and create within it –

123
00:06:11.541 --> 00:06:13.791
where did it come from?

124
00:06:13.791 --> 00:06:16.791
This

125
00:06:16.791 --> 00:06:19.416
has become possible only through

126
00:06:19.416 --> 00:06:25.041
the power of consciousness given by Me.

127
00:06:25.041 --> 00:06:29.458
When you directly experience

128
00:06:29.458 --> 00:06:32.125
that every thing,

129
00:06:32.125 --> 00:06:34.708
from the smallest blade

130
00:06:34.708 --> 00:06:39.750
of grass to the vast ocean,

131
00:06:39.750 --> 00:06:44.041
all exist only because of My presence,

132
00:06:44.041 --> 00:06:47.375
then the world around you

133
00:06:47.375 --> 00:06:50.791
begins to feel sacred,

134
00:06:50.791 --> 00:06:53.916
and even ordinary life

135
00:06:53.916 --> 00:06:58.166
begins to shine with divine light.

136
00:06:58.166 --> 00:06:59.875
This perspective

137
00:06:59.875 --> 00:07:03.666
awakens gratitude in your daily life,

138
00:07:03.666 --> 00:07:08.583
and a sense of joyful wonder.

139
00:07:08.583 --> 00:07:10.583
Every moment,

140
00:07:10.583 --> 00:07:12.958
every experience,

141
00:07:12.958 --> 00:07:17.333
you begin to see as a divine play.

142
00:07:17.333 --> 00:07:19.750
Whenever you

143
00:07:19.750 --> 00:07:23.625
are drawn toward something beautiful,

144
00:07:23.625 --> 00:07:26.916
remind your mind –

145
00:07:26.916 --> 00:07:29.041
this beauty

146
00:07:29.041 --> 00:07:34.208
is one small part of My vast divine beauty.

147
00:07:39.000 --> 00:07:41.500
Have you ever thought

148
00:07:41.500 --> 00:07:44.000
about what the true purpose

149
00:07:44.000 --> 00:07:47.125
of your human life

150
00:07:47.125 --> 00:07:50.791
and your family's life is?

151
00:07:50.791 --> 00:07:54.416
Among all forms of existence,

152
00:07:54.416 --> 00:08:00.041
I am the best of the best.

153
00:08:00.041 --> 00:08:06.250
The consciousness and life
force in all these forms

154
00:08:06.250 --> 00:08:08.666
is the greatest gift

155
00:08:08.666 --> 00:08:11.458
given by Me.

156
00:08:11.458 --> 00:08:13.958
Your consciousness

157
00:08:13.958 --> 00:08:17.000
connects you to Me deeply

158
00:08:17.000 --> 00:08:20.875
and personally.

159
00:08:20.875 --> 00:08:28.041
This is what makes your life meaningful.

160
00:08:28.041 --> 00:08:29.541
But

161
00:08:29.541 --> 00:08:31.708
see

162
00:08:31.708 --> 00:08:34.250
how today's society is misusing

163
00:08:34.250 --> 00:08:37.666
this sacred gift.

164
00:08:37.666 --> 00:08:40.750
The mind is kept continuously

165
00:08:40.750 --> 00:08:43.750
in distractions, negative thoughts,

166
00:08:43.750 --> 00:08:46.916
and only material pleasures.

167
00:08:46.916 --> 00:08:49.500
Instead of protecting

168
00:08:49.500 --> 00:08:52.875
and nourishing consciousness,

169
00:08:52.875 --> 00:08:57.791
many are busy corrupting it.

170
00:08:57.791 --> 00:08:59.291
Just as

171
00:08:59.291 --> 00:09:02.333
a strong home protects those inside

172
00:09:02.333 --> 00:09:04.791
from external disaster,

173
00:09:04.791 --> 00:09:07.875
in the same way, it is also your responsibility

174
00:09:07.875 --> 00:09:15.041
to protect your family's consciousness.

175
00:09:15.041 --> 00:09:17.125
As a family member

176
00:09:17.125 --> 00:09:19.291
or head of the family,

177
00:09:19.291 --> 00:09:21.875
it is your duty

178
00:09:21.875 --> 00:09:24.250
to protect this divine

179
00:09:24.250 --> 00:09:28.500
gift of consciousness and grow it.

180
00:09:28.500 --> 00:09:30.500
Not just for yourself,

181
00:09:30.500 --> 00:09:33.916
but for your loved ones too.

182
00:09:33.916 --> 00:09:37.708
Now how can you do this?

183
00:09:37.708 --> 00:09:44.041
By making the habits of your
mind and your family's virtuous.

184
00:09:44.041 --> 00:09:45.458
Shifting your attention

185
00:09:45.458 --> 00:09:49.541
from material things toward spiritual

186
00:09:49.541 --> 00:09:52.541
knowledge and meaningful conversation.

187
00:09:52.541 --> 00:09:54.000
Together with your family,

188
00:09:54.000 --> 00:09:56.750
study the scriptures.

189
00:09:56.750 --> 00:10:01.041
Create an atmosphere of peaceful learning.

190
00:10:01.041 --> 00:10:04.250
Just as a sanitation officer

191
00:10:04.250 --> 00:10:06.666
keeps the city clean

192
00:10:06.666 --> 00:10:10.500
and protects the health of all citizens,

193
00:10:10.500 --> 00:10:14.041
in the same way, when you give

194
00:10:14.041 --> 00:10:18.708
your own and your family's
consciousness higher knowledge,

195
00:10:18.708 --> 00:10:19.583
then you

196
00:10:19.583 --> 00:10:23.000
not only protect its purity,

197
00:10:23.000 --> 00:10:26.416
but also inspire your loved ones

198
00:10:26.416 --> 00:10:30.625
to grow in knowledge and joy.

199
00:10:30.625 --> 00:10:33.166
In this way, your family

200
00:10:33.166 --> 00:10:37.208
will not remain just a group
bound by material ties,

201
00:10:37.208 --> 00:10:39.500
but will become a centre

202
00:10:39.500 --> 00:10:43.416
of spiritual growth.

203
00:10:43.416 --> 00:10:47.166
Where every member, with Me,

204
00:10:47.166 --> 00:10:50.666
deepens their bond

205
00:10:50.666 --> 00:10:55.000
and grows in mutual love and respect.

206
00:10:59.708 --> 00:11:02.541
As I have said,

207
00:11:02.541 --> 00:11:04.083
that I am

208
00:11:04.083 --> 00:11:07.041
all-pervading.

209
00:11:07.041 --> 00:11:08.541
The light of the sun,

210
00:11:08.541 --> 00:11:09.833
the steadiness of mountains,

211
00:11:09.833 --> 00:11:14.000
the life force of all beings,

212
00:11:14.000 --> 00:11:17.041
all are My forms.

213
00:11:17.041 --> 00:11:19.750
I provide the world

214
00:11:19.750 --> 00:11:26.958
with its foundation according to its varied needs.

215
00:11:26.958 --> 00:11:29.708
And what can you do?

216
00:11:29.708 --> 00:11:30.958
You too

217
00:11:30.958 --> 00:11:34.791
can play the same role in your organisation.

218
00:11:34.791 --> 00:11:36.875
Think about it,

219
00:11:36.875 --> 00:11:42.000
as a group leader, what is your responsibility?

220
00:11:42.000 --> 00:11:43.916
Every team,

221
00:11:43.916 --> 00:11:46.750
every member, their unique abilities

222
00:11:46.750 --> 00:11:49.625
and needs to understand,

223
00:11:49.625 --> 00:11:52.791
and to support and assist them.

224
00:11:52.791 --> 00:11:54.208
Isn't it?

225
00:11:54.208 --> 00:11:57.750
Sometimes you will need to
motivate the sales team,

226
00:11:57.750 --> 00:12:01.666
sometimes give direction to the strategy team,

227
00:12:01.666 --> 00:12:06.291
and sometimes engage with
the communications team.

228
00:12:06.291 --> 00:12:10.166
Recognise the hidden talent in every member,

229
00:12:10.166 --> 00:12:13.375
nurture their strengths,

230
00:12:13.375 --> 00:12:17.541
and bring them together for a single purpose.

231
00:12:17.541 --> 00:12:21.875
When you lead with this understanding,

232
00:12:21.875 --> 00:12:25.250
your organisation will not only generate profits,

233
00:12:25.250 --> 00:12:29.875
but will become such a family

234
00:12:29.875 --> 00:12:32.250
where every member

235
00:12:32.250 --> 00:12:34.708
will feel their life

236
00:12:34.708 --> 00:12:37.250
enriched and meaningful.

237
00:12:37.250 --> 00:12:43.125
Think about how extraordinary
that leadership would be.

238
00:12:43.125 --> 00:12:46.416
Mind to mind united.

239
00:12:46.416 --> 00:12:49.541
Then unity will be unmatched.
